{"ok":true,"taskId":"task_IGp1Xry30Q06uleU45CENy0sJNiTNXN5","title":"路灯下的归途","tags":"Chinese folk pop, warm male vocal, acoustic guitar, 88 BPM, gentle, healing, night city","model":"chirp-hawk","mv":"v6","costHint":"一次提交约 ¥2.4（一次出 2 首，约 ¥1.2/首，以实际扣费为准）","lyrics":"[Verse 1]\n写字楼的灯一盏一盏关\n最后一班地铁开往终点站\n肩膀还留着加班的疲倦\n推开玻璃门走进深夜的凉\n\n[Verse 2]\n便利店招牌亮得很温柔\n热一杯豆浆暖我的手\n街角的猫在路灯下回头\n像在问我今天够不够\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n风把疲惫慢慢吹散\n远处有人为我留一盏灯\n\n[Chorus]\n走吧走吧 沿着路灯走回家\n星星也陪着你 不说话\n今天的累 就先放下吧\n明天的太阳 会记得你呀\n走吧走吧 前面就是家\n\n[Verse 3]\n楼下那扇窗还亮着光\n有人把饭菜又热了一遍\n你走得很慢却不再慌张\n影子陪着你走过长夜\n\n[Bridge]\n这城市睡得那么安静\n每盏灯都为晚归的人亮起\n\n[Chorus]\n走吧走吧 沿着路灯走回家\n星星也陪着你 不说话\n今天的累 就先放下吧\n明天的太阳 会记得你呀\n走吧走吧 前面就是家\n\n[Outro]\n门开了 有人轻轻唤你回来\n今夜好好睡 别怕明天","songs":[{"file":"C:\\Users\\ZhuanZ\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-p4yaFQ\\xiapan-e2e-102912\\out\\路灯下的归途-20261028023020-1.mp3","bytes":4833318,"title":"路灯下的归途","duration":200.8,"clipId":"baebc4ad-9780-43b0-894d-5268e4635044","imageUrl":"https://media.u-claw.org.cn/media/x/nebN96tms0I5yWX9pJ5-OU/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4yLnN1bm8uYWkvaW1hZ2VfYmFlYmM0YWQtOTc4MC00M2IwLTg5NGQtNTI2OGU0NjM1MDQ0LmpwZWc/image_baebc4ad-9780-43b0-894d-5268e4635044.jpeg","audioUrl":"https://media.u-claw.org.cn/media/x/x64Z0X9CaOimUEq_pM13TN/aHR0cHM6Ly9hcGlvc3MwLnN5ZG5leS1haS5jb20vaW1nLzExNC90OWlsXzkxZGpBb3BlN1ZOajhpZ1M1b3VqczJnWTcyeFh2V3dqYXdyZjAzdVgwWDQxWmxxZmFpd2phRkFYeGdMWDBrcFhhM2xYWlZ1XzAxR3RzSlZQN01Ua3BfbjFha3BYYTJMMXNKTGtwM3NZYUo4MWFXeFg4a3BmNzJnWHBrbC9iYWViYzRhZC05NzgwLTQzYjAtODk0ZC01MjY4ZTQ2MzUwNDQubXAz/baebc4ad-9780-43b0-894d-5268e4635044.mp3","model":"chirp-hawk","mv":"v6"},{"file":"C:\\Users\\ZhuanZ\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-p4yaFQ\\xiapan-e2e-102912\\out\\路灯下的归途-20261028023028-2.mp3","bytes":4837710,"title":"路灯下的归途","duration":202.4,"clipId":"187e3dac-b176-4f81-82ce-8520f49483ee","imageUrl":"https://media.u-claw.org.cn/media/x/tXMCW-JheKth-atBx9lZYE/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4yLnN1bm8uYWkvaW1hZ2VfMTg3ZTNkYWMtYjE3Ni00ZjgxLTgyY2UtODUyMGY0OTQ4M2VlLmpwZWc/image_187e3dac-b176-4f81-82ce-8520f49483ee.jpeg","audioUrl":"ht